   "points": [
    "The reference angle is the acute angle to the **$x$-axis**.",
    "QII: $180^\\circ-\\theta$ · QIII: $\\theta-180^\\circ$ · QIV: $360^\\circ-\\theta$.",
    "Make the angle coterminal in $[0^\\circ,360^\\circ)$ first.",
    "$1^\\circ=60'$: divide minutes by $60$, multiply decimals by $60$."
